{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13256","headline":"奉和独孤中丞游法华寺 · 皇甫冉","name":"奉和独孤中丞游法华寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢君临郡府，越国旧山川。\n访道三千界，当仁五百年。\n岩空驺驭响，树密斾旌连。\n阁影凌空壁，松声助乱泉。\n开门得初地，伏槛接诸天。\n向背春光满，楼台古制全。\n羣峰争彩翠，百谷会风烟。\n香象随僧久，祥乌报客先。\n清心乘暇日，稽首慕良缘。\n法证无生偈，诗成大雅篇。\n苍生望已久，回驾独依然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13256.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13256","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}